   "@id": "https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/great-depression/timeline/9",
   "@type": "uso:TimelineEntry",
   "rdfs:label": "Congress passes the Social Security Act, the Wagner Act and the relief appropriation that funds the Works Progress Administration.",
