    "@value": "1857-12-14"
   }
  },
  {
   "@id": "https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/morrill-land-grant-college-act/timeline/3",
   "@type": "uso:TimelineEntry",
   "rdfs:label": "President James Buchanan vetoes the bill passed by Congress, citing cost and constitutional limits on federal power.",
   "uso:date": {
